module @1:1-1:37
  para
    "Links and what could be unsafe."
val:x @4:1-16:80
  para
    "Raw HTML is text: bbold/b scriptalert(1)/script\n src=x onerror=alert(1) <img> &lt;i&gt;"
  para
    "Images are links: "
    link http://img.example/a.png
    ", "
    link https://img.example/b.png
      "a title"
    ",\n "
    link http://img.example/c.png
      "alt text"
    "."
  para
    "Unsafe images are text: a.png, t <data:image/png;base64,AAAA>."
  para
    "Links keep the full URL: "
    link https://example.com/a/b?c=d&e=f#g
      "a label"
    ",\n "
    link http://example.com/x
      "markdown "
      emphasis
        "label"
    ", "
    link https://example.com/auto?q=1
    "."
  para
    "Only http and https: click <javascript:alert(1)>, x <javascript:alert(1>),\n mailto:a@b.example, Other.html, ftp://example.com/f, //evil.example/x."
